											<h4>Storage condition</h4>
						<ul class="details">
															<li>Store at room temperature</li>
																						<li>Soluble in 1 N NaOH</li>
																				</ul>
																<h4>Hazard statements</h4>
<ul class="details">
	<li><span class="label label-warning">H302</span>  Harmful if swallowed</li>
	<li><span class="label label-warning">H318</span>  Causes serious eye damage</li>
</ul>
	
																<h4>Precautionary statements</h4>
<ul class="details">
	<li><span class="label label-warning">P280</span>  Wear protective gloves/protective clothing/eye protection/face protection</li>
	<li><span class="label label-warning">P301</span>  IF SWALLOWED:</li>
	<li><span class="label label-warning">P305</span>  IF IN EYES:</li>
	<li><span class="label label-warning">P312</span>  Call a POISON CENTER or doctor/physician if you feel unwell</li>
	<li><span class="label label-warning">P330</span>  Rinse mouth</li>
	<li><span class="label label-warning">P351</span>  Rinse continuously with water for several minutes</li>
</ul>	
